---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Accueil • TP/TD Visualisation de Données & Routes Astro">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-2">
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-3 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm border border-sky-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xs">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pink-100/70 border border-pink-200 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700">
        ✨ TP / TD • 5 Datasets Complets
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-800">
        Observable Plot & <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 to-rose-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Astro Routing</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base">
        Démonstrateur complet : routes paramétriques dynamiques (<strong>SSR</strong> avec <code>prerender = false</code>), génération statique (<strong>SSG</strong> avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>), onglets par boucle <code>map</code>, et filtres interactifs côté client.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section NOUVEAU TP : Accessibilité & Cartographie (Leaflet + GeoJSON) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          TP Cartographie & Accessibilité (a11y)
        </h2>
        <span class="badge badge-primary text-xs font-bold">Nouveau TP</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <!-- 0. Accessibilité -->
        <a href="/accessibilite" class="card bg-white/90 border-2 border-emerald-100 hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-lg transition group rounded-3xl p-1">
          <div class="card-body p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">♿</span>
              <span class="badge badge-xs badge-soft bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700">Partie 0</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title text-base font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition mt-3">
              0. Accessibilité (a11y)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Options <code>title</code>, <code>subtitle</code>, <code>caption</code>, <code>ariaLabel</code> et balisage sémantique <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> & <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- 1. Leaflet -->
        <a href="/leaflet" class="card bg-white/90 border-2 border-blue-100 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg transition group rounded-3xl p-1">
          <div class="card-body p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">🗺️</span>
              <span class="badge badge-xs badge-soft bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">Partie 1</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title text-base font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-blue-700 transition mt-3">
              1. Leaflet.JS
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Carte de France interactive avec 2 500+ implantations d'enseignement supérieur (<code>listeEtablissements.json</code>), popups et filtres.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- 2. GeoJSON Plot -->
        <a href="/geojson-plot" class="card bg-white/90 border-2 border-purple-100 hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-lg transition group rounded-3xl p-1">
          <div class="card-body p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">🌍</span>
              <span class="badge badge-xs badge-soft bg-purple-50 text-purple-700">Partie 2</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title text-base font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-purple-700 transition mt-3">
              2. GéoJSON Plot Client
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Carte choroplèthe de population par département avec 3 <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> réactifs côté client (Année, Sexe, Âge).
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1 : Manchots (Palmer Penguins) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
        1. Dataset Manchots (Palmer Penguins)
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <a href="/penguins" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">📑</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition mt-2">Onglets Manchots</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Graphiques par espèce générés par boucle <code>map</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/penguins/specie" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🐧</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition mt-2">Par Espèce (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes <code>/penguins/specie/[species]</code> avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/penguins/island" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🏝️</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition mt-2">Par Île (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes <code>/penguins/island/[island]</code> avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/penguins/sex" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">⚧️</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition mt-2">Par Sexe (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes <code>/penguins/sex/[sex]</code> avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 : Tous les autres datasets (Chaises, Consoles 3DS, Cinéma, Voitures) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>
        2. Chaises, Consoles 3DS, Cinéma & Voitures
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <!-- Chaises -->
        <a href="/chaises/category" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🪑</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition mt-2">Chaises (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes statiques par catégorie avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Consoles 3DS -->
        <a href="/consoles/genre" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🎮</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition mt-2">3DS (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes statiques par genre de jeu avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Cinéma -->
        <a href="/movies/genre" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-rose-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🎬</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition mt-2">Cinéma (SSG)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Routes statiques par genre de film avec <code>getStaticPaths</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Voitures SSR -->
        <a href="/cars/year" class="card bg-white/90 border border-sky-100 hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-md transition group rounded-2xl">
          <div class="card-body p-5">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">🚗</span>
            <h3 class="card-title text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-700 transition mt-2">Voitures (SSR)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Route dynamique SSR <code>/cars/year/[year]</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
